#. Tag: title
#: man-khangman.6.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: man-khangman.6.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&khangman; is a game based on the well known hangman game. It is aimed for "
"children 6 and above. It has several levels of difficulty: A lot of "
"categories like Animals (animals words) and Easy, Medium and Hard."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: man-khangman.6.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A word is picked at random and the letters are hidden. You must guess the "
"word by trying one letter after another. Each time you guess a wrong letter, "
"part of a picture of a hangman is drawn. You must guess the word before "
"getting hanged! You have 10 tries."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: man-khangman.6.docbook:41
